      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768155479199999
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit, my name is Judy. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 206,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768155482266665
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi, I need to start a return for a VeloBand I just bought.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 15146,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768155487333331
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help with that. Do you have the order number handy?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 206,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768155491399997
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, it's VF-8675309.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 15146,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768155496066663
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. Let me pull that up... Okay, I see the VeloBand GPS Tracker, delivered on December 29th. Is that correct?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 206,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768155497666663
    },
    {
      "text": "That's the one.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 15146,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768155505599996
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright, one moment... Okay, our policy allows returns within 90 days, so you're well within that window. No problem, I can get this return processed immediately.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 206,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768155506799996
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, really? That's great. I was worried it had been too long.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 15146,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768155517799996
    },
    {
      "text": "Not at all! I see here that you're a VIP member with us, so we definitely want to make this as easy as possible for you. I've just authorized the return. I'm emailing the pre-paid return label to you right now.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 206,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768155522066662
    },
    {
      "text": "Wow, that was fast. So I just print that out and send the band back?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 15146,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768155536266662
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly. Just attach the label to the original box and drop it with your mail carrier. Once we receive it, you'll see a full refund in 3-5 business days. And as a small thank you for being a loyal customer, I've also added a 20% discount code to your account for your next VeloFit purchase.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 206,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768155540999995
    },
    {
      "text": "That's very generous. Thank you so much, Judy.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 15146,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768155560533328
    },
    {
      "text": "You are very welcome! Is there anything else I can assist you with today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 206,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768155563799994
